512	     * Counts how many existing owners belong to the same household as the owner being created, i.e.
513	     * share its {@code householdId} (derived by {@link Households#householdId} from the normalized last
514	     * name and postcode). The value excludes the owner being created (which has not yet been saved), so
515	     * the household's size after this create is this count plus one. It is stored on the new owner.
516	     *
517	     * @param lastName the last name of the owner being created
518	     * @param postcode the postcode of the owner being created
519	     * @return the number of existing owners sharing this owner's household
520	     */
